{"id":"658217","name":"艾叶青团","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658217/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"艾叶","amount":"500g"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"700g"},{"name":"澄面","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"烤花生","amount":"120g"},{"name":"炒黑芝麻","amount":"100g"},{"name":"炒白芝麻","amount":"20g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜采摘的艾叶。","img":"images/658217/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"糯米粉、澄面也叫小麦淀粉。","img":"images/658217/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"烤花生，炒芝麻，白砂糖。","img":"images/658217/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用水烧开倒入艾叶。","img":"images/658217/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入五克小苏打，煮两分钟，把苦涩味煮掉即可。","img":"images/658217/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出后放入凉水中。","img":"images/658217/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"攥干水分。","img":"images/658217/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"艾叶放入破壁机，加入750ml的水。","img":"images/658217/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅打成汁。","img":"images/658217/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"打好的青汁，重新倒入锅内煮开。","img":"images/658217/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煮开后关火，放入糯米粉和澄面。","img":"images/658217/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再加入100克的白糖。","img":"images/658217/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"活成面团。","img":"images/658217/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"接下来做馅，芝麻放入打粉机。","img":"images/658217/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"打成粉末。","img":"images/658217/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"接着打烤花生，喜欢吃颗粒状的，用擀面杖碾碎即可，只因我家老人牙口不好，所以打成粉末了。","img":"images/658217/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"打好的花生末。","img":"images/658217/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"芝麻、花生、糖拌一起。","img":"images/658217/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"搅拌均匀即可。","img":"images/658217/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"取一个面剂搓成圆球。","img":"images/658217/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"做成小窝。","img":"images/658217/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"加入馅料，把口封住即可。","img":"images/658217/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"搓成圆球，垫上油纸。","img":"images/658217/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"水开入锅蒸十分钟。","img":"images/658217/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"时间到。","img":"images/658217/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"表面刷上熟油防粘。","img":"images/658217/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"外皮有艾草的清香，软糯Q弹，花生芝麻馅又酥又香。","img":"images/658217/step_27.jpg"},{"step":28,"desc":"成品。清明节气吃艾叶青团，寓意着团圆，同时也表达对先人思念之情。","img":"images/658217/step_28.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}